1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,899
Hi, little friends! I'm Qiqi.

2
00:00:04,200 --> 00:00:08,339
Welcome back to Qiqi Meets Alice!

3
00:00:08,640 --> 00:00:19,660
Last time, Qiqi followed a white rabbit in a vest and jumped down a rabbit hole!

4
00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:27,859
Wow, what a magical place! What will Qiqi find today?

5
00:00:28,160 --> 00:00:31,019
Qiqi walked down a long hallway.

6
00:00:31,320 --> 00:00:35,780
At the end, there was a little table with three things on it.

7
00:00:36,079 --> 00:00:41,420
Huh? A bottle that says — "Drink Me."

8
00:00:41,719 --> 00:00:46,500
And a cake that says — "Eat Me."

9
00:00:46,799 --> 00:00:52,780
There's also a little fan in the corner, so pretty!

10
00:00:53,079 --> 00:00:57,619
How curious! Let me try a sip first!

11
00:00:57,919 --> 00:01:00,379
Qiqi picked up the bottle and took a sip.

12
00:01:00,679 --> 00:01:06,419
Suddenly — Qiqi started shrinking, shrinking, shrinking!

13
00:01:06,719 --> 00:01:12,379
Whoa! I'm so tiny! Only as tall as a teacup!

14
00:01:12,679 --> 00:01:16,339
Tiny Qiqi saw a beautiful garden behind a little door.

15
00:01:16,639 --> 00:01:25,579
I want to go in! But... the key is on the table. I can't reach it!

16
00:01:25,879 --> 00:01:30,979
I know! The cake will make me bigger again!

17
00:01:31,279 --> 00:01:33,359
Qiqi took a big bite of the cake.

18
00:01:33,659 --> 00:01:38,219
This time — Qiqi started growing, growing, and growing!

19
00:01:38,519 --> 00:01:44,499
Oh no! I'm so big! My head is touching the ceiling!

20
00:01:44,799 --> 00:01:48,779
Hehe, I'm a giant now!

21
00:01:49,079 --> 00:01:55,619
Qiqi was so big, she waved her arm — CRASH! The bookshelf fell over!

22
00:01:55,919 --> 00:01:59,739
The alarm clock flew up! Teacups rolled everywhere!

23
00:02:00,039 --> 00:02:04,339
Sorry, sorry! I didn't mean it!

24
00:02:04,639 --> 00:02:09,519
Qiqi tried to go through the door, but she was too big and got stuck.

25
00:02:09,819 --> 00:02:14,759
I can't get out... What should I do...

26
00:02:15,059 --> 00:02:19,279
Oh no... I made a mess...

27
00:02:19,579 --> 00:02:25,799
Qiqi was almost in tears. She sat down and thought and thought.

28
00:02:26,099 --> 00:02:29,199
Then she noticed a little fan in the corner of the table.

29
00:02:29,500 --> 00:02:36,919
When did this get here? Let me try!

30
00:02:37,219 --> 00:02:40,639
Qiqi picked up the fan and gave it a gentle wave.

31
00:02:40,939 --> 00:02:46,520
Something magical happened — Qiqi slowly returned to her normal size!

32
00:02:46,820 --> 00:02:53,040
I'm back! Not too big, not too small — just right!

33
00:02:53,340 --> 00:02:58,920
Qiqi unlocked the little door with the key and stepped into the beautiful garden.

34
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:07,120
When you're in a hurry, stop and think — the answer might be right beside you!

35
00:03:07,420 --> 00:03:16,280
Little friends, if you could be big or small, what would you want to be?

36
00:03:16,580 --> 00:03:19,920
Tell Qiqi in the comments!

37
00:03:20,220 --> 00:03:26,680
Next time, Qiqi gets lost and meets a smiling cat!

38
00:03:26,980 --> 00:03:30,480
Good night, see you tomorrow! 🌈

